sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Browser as 浏览器 (React)
    participant Go as Go 后端 :8080
    participant MySQL as MySQL
    participant Redis as Redis

    User->>Browser: 访问 /share
    Browser->>Go: GET /api/papers/stats/tc-pressure
    Go->>Redis: 检查缓存 chart:tc_pressure
    alt 缓存命中
        Redis-->>Go: 缓存数据 (gzip 压缩)
    else 缓存未命中
        Go->>MySQL: SELECT material, value_max, pressure_gpa, paper_id FROM key_properties
        MySQL-->>Go: 579 条数据
        Go->>Redis: 写入永久缓存
        Go-->>Browser: JSON (gzip 6.7 kB)
    end
    Browser->>Browser: ChartScatter 渲染散点图

    User->>Browser: 点击数据点
    Browser->>Browser: onPointClick → setSelectedPaperId(4)
    Browser->>Go: GET /api/papers/4
    Go->>MySQL: Preload Paper + KeyProperties
    MySQL-->>Go: 论文 + 3 条物性记录
    Go-->>Browser: JSON (基础信息 + key_properties + methodology)
    Browser->>Browser: PaperDetailDrawer 弹出详情面板
    User->>Browser: 关闭 Drawer
    Browser->>Browser: setSelectedPaperId(null)
